    "content": "<p class=\"d\">A Song of degrees.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"1\" data-sid=\"PSA 134:1\" class=\"v\">1</span>Behold, bless ye the <span class=\"nd\">LORD</span>, all <span class=\"add\">ye</span> servants of the <span class=\"nd\">LORD</span>, which by night stand in the house of the <span class=\"nd\">LORD</span>.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"2\" data-sid=\"PSA 134:2\" class=\"v\">2</span>Lift up your hands <span class=\"add\">in</span> the sanctuary, and bless the <span class=\"nd\">LORD</span>.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"3\" data-sid=\"PSA 134:3\" class=\"v\">3</span>The <span class=\"nd\">LORD</span> that made heaven and earth bless thee out of Zion.</p>",
